    "AI Notes": {
      "value": "M/M (Paris) is the Paris studio of Mathias Augustyniak (b. 1967) and Michael Amzalag (b. 1968), founded 1992 after both trained at Ecole Nationale Superieure des Arts Decoratifs. They operate across graphic design, editorial, identity, type design, and spatial/exhibition design, with deep roots in fashion (Vogue Paris art direction 2001-2003, current creative directors of Harper's Bazaar Italia from Sept 2025), music (Bjork, Madonna, Kanye West), and contemporary art. Key institutional clients include Palais de Tokyo (full identity + custom typeface), Prada Foundation, and Louvre. Studio-level principals, ~30 years running; Autonomy 5 is certain. LinkedIn lists ~5 employees total; core team is the two founders. Work Status Studio confirmed: founded, active studio with employees, not freelancers. Email anyone@mmparis.com from mmparis.com contact page; theagent@mmparis.com for gallery/commercial rep.",
